{"data":{"body":"**P2:** This now recognizes every terminal status, but `replay()` only accepts `SUCCEEDED` and `FAILED`. A reinvocation after `CANCELLED`, `TIMED_OUT`, or `STOPPED` therefore terminates with `IllegalDurableOperationException` instead of replaying the cached terminal outcome; `get()` can also dereference absent `stepDetails`. Accept all terminal statuses during replay, decode missing error details safely, and add full replay tests for these statuses.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77AJjJ","finding_digest":"62386d12413283b45eea14c9ae8b3798a4f6ae893c21141a661c7e7d26000252","finding_id":"arf_v1_mi4g2esbgkb3ixxkcte25czxtc","finding_key":"waitforconditionoperation::replay::terminal-status-consistency","identity_key":"waitforconditionoperation::replay::terminal-status-consistency","line":140,"observation_digest":"5c12280db32ebc621dce5f01b495630e29e7a56a00ef9e5fb468ab3a0365e8a0","observation_id":"aro_v1_lqjcqdntf26gehool4a3jfldby","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/WaitForConditionOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T19:32:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tbonb7nouwg5d3yc2mjn7e3ouy","reviewed_base_sha":"95a63f3a9db5d327620d76fb95b8372f53db6eaa","reviewed_head_sha":"5cb66fdd5fda26360254ea29890eddc3a1f2f7f0","reviewer":"codex","start_line":140,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_xtezcclp4mehcgvkdwsez6a3do","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T19:32:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
